BioKey does not collect, store, or share any personal data.

The application processes sensor data locally on the device
(breath patterns, sleep timing, audio feedback) solely to provide
its core functionality.

No data is sold, shared with third parties, or used for advertising.

Network communication is used only for anonymized, non-identifiable
collective resonance signals. No precise location, personal identifiers,
or account information are transmitted.

